{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/planarLayout()"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/planarlayout()"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A crossing-free straight-line drawing on an integer grid, or nil when the graph is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"planar."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"planarLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The drawing, in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, or nil when the graph has no planar embedding."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The drawing comes from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"planarEmbedding()"},{"type":"text","text":" by de Fraysseix, Pach and Pollack’s shift method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in Chrobak and Payne’s linear-time form. The embedding of the underlying simple graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(self-loops and parallel copies drawn as one segment) is first made connected, by an edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the first vertex of each component to the first vertex of the next, and every face"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"boundary a simple cycle; then every face but the largest (the outer face) is triangulated."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The vertices are placed in a canonical ordering of that graph, each one above the contour"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of those before it, the contour shifted to make room. The added edges are not drawn and not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported. Every vertex has integer coordinates with 0 ≤ x ≤ 2n − 4 and 0 ≤ y ≤ n − 2, and no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"two edges cross or overlap. Fewer than four vertices are placed at (0, 0), (2, 0) and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(1, 1) in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order. The drawing is not rescaled ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rescaled(scale:center:)"},{"type":"text","text":" maps it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a common frame). A directed graph is drawn through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"undirectedView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"de Fraysseix, Pach and Pollack, “How to draw a planar graph on a grid”, Combinatorica"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"10(1), 1990."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Chrobak and Payne, “A linear-time algorithm for drawing a planar graph on a grid”,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Information Processing Letters 54(4), 1995."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n + m) for the embedding, then O(n) expected (hashing the triangulation’s vertex pairs).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"planarEmbedding()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"planarLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Drawing"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":">?"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE12planarLayoutAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGSgyF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"GraphDrawing","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PlanarLayout.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/PlanarLayout.swift#L31"},"role":"symbol","title":"planarLayout()"},"references":{"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/Drawing":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Drawing"}],"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/drawing","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Drawing"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","type":"topic","title":"Drawing","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A position in the plane for each vertex, in a fixed vertex order: what every layout in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"module returns, and what a caller passes as a starting drawing."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph/planarLayout()":{"title":"planarLayout()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"planarLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">?","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/planarLayout()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A crossing-free straight-line drawing on an integer grid, or nil when the graph is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"planar."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/planarlayout()"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing":{"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","type":"topic","title":"GraphDrawing","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols","title":"GraphProtocols","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GraphDrawing/documentation/GraphDrawing/GraphProtocols/Graph":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"extension"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Graph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Graph"}],"title":"Graph","kind":"symbol"}}}